'''Old Guys About Town''' (町でみたすごい老人, ''Machi de Mita Sugoi Rōjin'', '''Amazing Old Men Around Town''') is the September event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Old Guys About Town'''}} returns to The Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to challenge {{Color|#FF0000|'''Mighty Gui Zuli'''}}, {{Color|#FF0000|'''Hermit Peng'''}} and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Master Da Xun'''}} and rescue {{Color|#0000FF|'''Kung Fu Cat X'''}} from his rivals!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available September 1st (11:00am) thru October 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Kung Fu Cat X'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

※ After you have picked up Kung Fu Cat X, unlock it at the {{Color|#008F03|'''Rare Cats'''}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Kung Fu Cat X from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

